    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a standard Data Processing Agreement (DPA) template that outlines Nexus Engineering S.r.l. obligations as a data processor, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are willing to negotiate and finalize a DPA with the client to ensure compliance with the GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further mitigate potential risks, I suggest including contractual provisions that address the following: (1) clear definitions of performance metrics and targets; (2) notification procedures in case of non-compliance; (3) penalty structures for non-compliance; and (4) termination clauses in the event of material breach." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By incorporating these measures into our contract, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can minimize potential risks and ensure a mutually beneficial partnership with the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I must emphasize that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. capabilities and resources, as outlined in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. context, will be the limiting factor in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. ability to meet the client performance targets." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget is estimated at 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must remain compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose to ensure a competitive bid?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, the target gross margin percentage is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, considering the minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18%, our should aim to stay within this range." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To estimate our projected margin on this contract, our first need to determine the total revenue over 4 years, which is given as 3 million euros. our pricing model does not explicitly state how to calculate the price for a contract of this nature, but our can use the target gross margin percentage as a guideline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our aim for the target gross margin percentage, our cost would be 72% of the total revenue, and our profit would be 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without knowing the exact cost structure for this contract, it's challenging to provide an accurate estimate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our financials, our have a net profit of 380,000 euros and an annual revenue of 4,200,000 euros. a net profit of 380,000 euros and an annual revenue of 4,200,000 euros indicates that our current net profit margin is around 9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, around 9% is not directly applicable to this contract due to differences in project specifics and cost structures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To propose cost-optimization strategies and ensure a competitive bid, our could consider the following based on our context:  1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Absorb costs via rate renegotiation with subcontractors if possible, as indicated by our budget reduction strategy for a 10% impact. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Scope reduction or removal of optional modules to minimize costs while maintaining essential deliverables, aligning with our approach for a 20% budget reduction impact. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Leveraging our standard daily rates for senior personnel and optimizing resource allocation to ensure the most cost-effective use of our workforce." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since our don't have specific details on this contract required resources, infrastructure costs, or other expenses, it's essential to conduct a thorough analysis of the project requirements and our capabilities to provide a precise bid that meets both our target margin and the client's budgetary constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval seeks an artificial intelligence solution that can assist agents in agents daily missions, improve the quality of answers, and reduce processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we design to meet these requirements, and how can we demonstrate we capacity for innovation in the tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The City of Belval requirements, we can leverage we expertise in AI research and development, particularly in natural language processing and information retrieval. we proposed solution will focus on designing an intelligent assistance tool that integrates with existing systems of information and business software to provide contextualized answers, facilitate continuity of file processing, and ensure data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The AI components can include a Retrieval-Augmented Generator (RAG) model, such as we preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, which can be fine-tuned using we expertise in LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tuning methods to adapt to the specific administrative context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable an intelligent assistance tool that integrates with existing systems of information and business software to provide contextualized answers, facilitate continuity of file processing, and ensure data protection to provide accurate and relevant answers while ensuring explainability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve the quality of answers, we can implement a hybrid retrieval strategy combining dense vector semantic search and BM25 sparse retrieval, allowing for effective information retrieval from internal procedures and applicable regulations. we RAG capabilities, with a typical retrieval precision at 5 of 0.87 and answer relevance score of 0.84, will ensure high-quality responses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce processing times, we can optimize the model using quantization methods such as INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ), reducing energy consumption while maintaining performance. we expertise in optimizing AI models for low-latency inference will enable an intelligent assistance tool that integrates with existing systems of information and business software to provide contextualized answers, facilitate continuity of file processing, and ensure data protection to respond within 2 seconds, meeting the required time of response constraint. we innovation strategy will focus on demonstrating we capacity for innovation through a pilot phase, followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of the services. we will conduct quarterly evaluations to assess Our proposed solution performance, incorporating user feedback and adapting to changing requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate we capacity for innovation in the tender response, we can highlight our: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Expertise in AI research and development, with 7 years of experience and 14 team members, including 3 PhD researchers. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Published papers and open-source contributions, such as LangChain plugins, RAG evaluation toolkit, and French NER model (HuggingFace). 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Experience with deploying models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, CamemBERT, and Falcon 7B in production environments. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ability to fine-tune models using various methods, ensuring adaptability to the City of Belval's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By showcasing we AI expertise, innovation capabilities, and commitment to meeting the client's requirements, we can demonstrate we capacity for innovation and provide a compelling tender response that addresses the City of Belval's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client aims to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information and expects a solution that contributes to reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we propose a sustainable solution that relies on low-carbon impact infrastructures, and what eco-friendly practices can we highlight in we bid to demonstrate we commitment to CSR?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is committed to reducing Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To propose a sustainable solution, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can rely on Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which are located in France and use 100% renewable energy. our green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which are located in France and use 100% renewable energy Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) ratings of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively demonstrate our green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which are located in France and use 100% renewable energy efficient energy usage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can also highlight Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices contribute to reducing energetic consumption and minimizing electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can emphasize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon reporting capability, which aligns with the GRI Standards (partial), and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. typical energy reduction of 35% compared to baseline levels." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. e-waste management partner, Ecologic, is certified for WEEE recycling, ensuring responsible disposal of electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these eco-friendly practices and low-carbon impact infrastructures, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can demonstrate Nexus Engineering S.r.l. commitment to CSR and propose a sustainable solution that meets the client's expectations for reducing energetic consumption and environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "**Executive Summary** Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development, proposes an innovative solution to the City of Belval's call for tenders." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development solution, an intelligent assistance tool, will improve administrative services efficiency and quality, while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and minimizing environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development will leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development experience in public sector projects, such as Comune di Torino and Regione Lombardia, to deliver a tailored solution that meets the City of Belval's objectives. **Understanding of Requirements** the City of Belval's seeks an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, improving access to information, answer quality, and reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with existing systems of information and business software, ensure data protection, and comply with regulatory requirements such as GDPR. proposes addresses regulatory requirements such as GDPR, providing a comprehensive solution that meets the City of Belval's needs. **Proposed Solution** Proposed Solution is based on a microservices architecture, utilizing containerization with Docker and orchestration with Kubernetes (K8s)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development will integrate Proposed Solution with existing systems of information and business software using APIs, specifically REST, GraphQL, SOAP, and CMIS." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development expertise in API gateways such as Kong, Apigee, and AWS API Gateway will facilitate seamless integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For Our solution, an intelligent assistance tool, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development will use a Retrieval-Augmented Generator (RAG) model, specifically Mistral 7B Instruct, which can be fine-tuned using LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tuning methods to adapt to the specific administrative context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable Our solution, an intelligent assistance tool to provide accurate and relevant answers while ensuring explainability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure data protection, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development will implement robust security controls such as multi-factor authentication (MFA) using TOTP or FIDO2, role-based access control (RBAC), and privileged access management (PAM) solutions like CyberArk Conjur or HashiCorp Vault." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development will also use data anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) or custom NER models to protect sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Solution will be hosted on a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure, specifically OVHcloud or Scaleway, which uses 100% renewable energy and has a Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) rating of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development will also implement auto-scaling, query caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle to reduce energetic consumption and minimize electronic waste. **Cost Estimation** Based on Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development target gross margin percentage of 28%, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development estimate the total revenue over the four years to be 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development cost would be 72% of the total revenue, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development profit would be 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without knowing the exact cost structure for this project, it's challenging to provide an accurate estimate. **Regulatory Compliance** Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development will ensure compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR, specifically Articles 5 and 6, which govern data protection and processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development Data Protection Officer (DPO) will oversee the implementation of Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development data protection policy, which includes data anonymization, encryption, and access controls. **Innovation Strategy** Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development innovation strategy focuses on demonstrating Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development capacity for innovation through a pilot phase, followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium with expertise in AI research and development will conduct quarterly evaluations to assess The solution performance, incorporating user feedback and adapting to changing requirements. **Unaddressed Requirements** None of the requirements from the tender are unaddressed in proposes. **Conclusion** Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is confident that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposed solution meets the City of Belval's objectives, providing an intelligent assistance tool that improves administrative services efficiency and quality while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and minimizing environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. look forward to collaborating with the City of Belval's to deliver a tailored solution that addresses the City of Belval's specific needs. **Appendix** Nexus Engineering S.r.l. team consists of 14 members, including 3 PhD researchers, with expertise in AI research and development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have published papers and open-source contributions, such as LangChain plugins, RAG evaluation toolkit, and French NER model (HuggingFace)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. deployment experience includes models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, CamemBERT, and Falcon 7B." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. pricing model is based on standard daily rates for senior personnel, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. optimize resource allocation to ensure cost-effective use of Nexus Engineering S.r.l. workforce." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are committed to CSR and sustainability, with a focus on reducing environmental footprint and minimizing electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. believe that proposes provides a comprehensive solution that meets the City of Belval's requirements, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. look forward to discussing proposes in further detail." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

