        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's have collaborated with Regione Lombardia on an AI-powered document management system project worth 2.4 million euros, lasting 30 months, completed in 2023." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's have also worked with Métropole de Lyon on an intelligent citizen services platform project valued at 3.1 million euros, which took 36 months to complete and was finished in 2024." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These projects showcase our company's capabilities in delivering complex public sector projects that aim to enhance the efficiency and quality of administrative services, aligning with the City of Belval's objectives to improve administrative services efficiency and quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires integration with existing systems of information, business softwares (civil status, town planning), electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technology stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do our propose to ensure seamless integration and high performance? our has experience in integrating with various systems through APIs, and our support several API standards such as REST, GraphQL, SOAP, and CMIS. our can leverage our expertise in API gateways like Kong, Apigee, and AWS API Gateway to facilitate the integration process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integrating with business softwares like civil status and town planning, our can utilize our experience with ERP/CRM connectors for systems like SAP, Salesforce, Oracle, Ciril/ARPÈGE, and OXALIS. our also have knowledge of Ged systems such as Alfresco, Maarch Courrier, and OpenKM, which can be useful for integrating with electronic management of documents (EDM)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with user directories, our can use our experience with identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP, Keycloak, and FranceConnect." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of architecture, our propose a microservices-based approach with containerization using Docker and orchestration using Kubernetes (K8s) and Helm. a microservices-based approach with containerization using Docker and orchestration using Kubernetes (K8s) and Helm will enable our to deploy and manage the integrated system efficiently and ensure high performance. our can use our experience with message brokers like Apache Kafka and RabbitMQ to handle communication between different microservices and systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our expertise in monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack will help our ensure the integrated system availability and performance meet the client's expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee high availability, our can design the system to be deployed on a cloud provider with which our have experience, such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, or Outscale (SecNumCloud), and utilize a cloud provider with which we have experience, such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, or Outscale (SecNumCloud) scalability features. our experience with Terraform and Ansible as IaC tools will also help our manage the infrastructure efficiently." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our current technology stack can meet the client's integration requirements, and a well-designed microservices-based architecture can ensure seamless integration and high performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender emphasizes strict GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and explicability of AI recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that we solution meets strict GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and explicability of AI recommendations, and what security controls should be implemented to protect sensitive data?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Security and Compliance Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with regulatory frameworks such as GDPR and has appointed a Data Protection Officer (DPO) whose contact is dpo@nexus-engineering.it." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are also certified with ISO 27001, which includes the scope of Design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure strict GDPR compliance, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can implement data anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) or custom NER models to protect sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with anonymisation tools and can ensure that personal data is not used in training pipelines without proper anonymization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers by default unless there's an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data sovereignty, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that all data is hosted exclusively within the European Union (EU), as per Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard data residency policy. ensure aligns with the client's requirement for data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explicability of AI recommendations, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with AI security controls such as output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, and confidence threshold escalation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can also provide model isolation through an inference API to prevent direct access to models by end-users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. conduct regular security reviews of model updates to ensure the integrity of Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "AI solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, we should implement robust security controls such as multi-factor authentication (MFA) using TOTP or hardware tokens (FIDO2), role-based access control (RBAC), and privileged access management (PAM) solutions like CyberArk Conjur or HashiCorp Vault." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have experience with zero-trust architecture, micro-segmentation, and defense-in-depth patterns to protect against unauthorized access." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. incident response plan includes a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) and playbooks for responding to security incidents, ensuring that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can quickly respond to any potential data breaches or security incidents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. average time to conduct a Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA) is 3 weeks, which can help identify and mitigate potential risks associated with our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these measures, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that our solution meets the client's regulatory requirements for GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and explicability of AI recommendations while protecting sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a high level of availability (99.9%) and a time of response lower than 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the legal implications of not meeting a high level of availability (99.9%) and a time of response lower than 2 seconds, and how can we mitigate potential risks through contractual clauses and service level agreements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I must emphasize that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard contractual clauses include a limitation of liability, which is capped at 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, 3 million euros may not be sufficient to cover the potential damages resulting from failure to meet The client performance targets." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In the event of non-compliance with the expected availability and response time, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. may face contractual penalties or even termination of the contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate these risks, I recommend including a Service Level Agreement (SLA) in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. contract that outlines specific performance metrics, such as availability and response time, and the corresponding penalties for non-compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard contractual clauses already include a penalty mechanism for SLA non-compliance, which could be leveraged to address the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. may consider including a termination for cause notice period of 30 days in the event of material breach of the contract, as per Our standard contractual clauses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is also essential to ensure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. subcontractors, if any, are aware of and comply with the same performance targets and SLA requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As part of Nexus Engineering S.r.l. subcontracting policy, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. conduct legal and financial due diligence on all subcontractors, which includes verifying all subcontractors ability to meet the required performance standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of data protection, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is committed to complying with the GDPR and ensuring that all personal data is processed in accordance with the GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

